```
PENDING → CONFIRMED (📧 Confirmation) → PACKED → 
DISPATCHED (📧 Dispatched) → OUT_FOR_DELIVERY (📧 Out for Delivery) → 
DELIVERED (📧 Delivered)

OR

CANCELLED (📧 Cancelled + Refund Initiated) → 
REFUND_INITIATED (📧 Refund Initiated) → 
REFUND_COMPLETED (📧 Refund Completed)
```

