### Configuration:

```jsx
<InnerImageZoom
    src={data.image[image]}
    zoomSrc={data.image[image]}
    alt={data.name}
    zoomScale={1.5}              // 150% zoom
    zoomType="hover"             // or "click"
    className='w-full h-full object-scale-down'
/>
```

### Technical Details:

**Library:** react-inner-image-zoom v4.0.1
- Size: ~15KB (lightweight)
- License: MIT (free)
- Mobile: Full touch support
- Performance: 60 FPS animations
- Browser: All modern browsers

**CSS Import Path (CRITICAL):**
```javascript
import 'react-inner-image-zoom/lib/styles.min.css'
// NOT: lib/InnerImageZoom/styles.css
```

